<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT - Art Life rated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Art Life rated.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nikko Research Center Ltd has assigned Art Life Co Ltd a &quot;3&quot; rating, Nikko brokers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute assigns a &quot;3&quot; rating to issues whose values it expects will underperform the key 225-share Nikkei average by more than 10 percentage points over the following six months.</p>
</text>
